{
  "slug": "create-claude-plugin",
  "name": "Create Claude Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "End-to-end skill for creating a Claude Code plugin: scaffold, build, test, host, and submit to the official Anthropic marketplace.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `create-claude-plugin` (Use when the user wants to create, package, publish, resume mid-development, maintain, rename, or check the status of…), `og-card` (Use when generating an Open Graph social-preview image (1200×630 PNG) for a Claude Code plugin repo, so link…), `proof-of-value` (Use when generating a proof-of-value artifact for a Claude Code plugin — a visual before/after, benchmark chart, terminal…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install create-claude-plugin@claude-community` from `codyhxyz/create-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
